      <title>主动AI最难的不是生成洞见，而是决定是否开口</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260904/%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8AI%E6%9C%80%E9%9A%BE%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%B4%9E%E8%A7%81%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%A3/</link>
